<item>
<title>菲防长：如中国动武可援引条约让美军介入中媒：废纸一张近日中方与菲律宾政界爆发口水战，中国驻菲大使井泉称如对菲动武可轻易取</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10396</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10396</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 10:19:07 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>菲防长：如中国动武可援引条约让美军介入<br/>中媒：废纸一张</b><br/><br/>近日中方与菲律宾政界爆发口水战，中国驻菲大使井泉称如对菲动武可轻易取胜，但中国爱好和平，言论引发菲律宾政界反弹，有议员动议驱逐井泉出境。<br/><br/>菲律宾当地华文报引用消息称，中方正考虑十项反制措施，包括拖走该舰、停止补给、断供成品油化肥，中方未证实。菲律宾防长特奥多罗10月23日警告，中国若以武力拖走坐滩仁爱礁的“马德雷山”号军舰，将构成“战争行为”。<br/><br/>特奥多罗又称，若中方人员登舰，可能援引《美菲共同防御条约》要求美军共同应对，但由总统马科斯决定。中媒《环球时报》批评特奥多罗想躲在美国身后恐吓中国，称任何“条约”在与中国开战的风险面前只是废纸。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E5%86%9B%E4%BA%8B">#军事</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%8D%97%E6%B5%B7">#南海</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4">#外交</a> <a href="?q=%23%E8%8F%B2%E5%BE%8B%E5%AE%BE">#菲律宾</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《美国之音》<a href="https://www.voachinese.com/a/philippine-warns-china-towing-away-brp-sierra-madre-would-be-act-of-war-20261023/8214549.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">菲律宾就第二托马斯浅滩军舰警告中国：拖走“马德雷山”号将被视为“战争行为”</a><br/>《联合早报》<a href="https://www.zaobao.com/news/china/story20261019-9859661" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">菲律宾外交部召见中国驻菲大使 抗议“动武可轻易取胜”言论</a><br/>《凤凰网》<a href="https://news.ifeng.com/c/8xVD4AHlGH2" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">“菲律宾防长提着纸糊的盾牌对中国发起冲锋”</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/fAdjS33MYOBNGucCPfahQCJdQ9D_cvctghqObWq1UVfqo_ETV7manu-j1YQbxSHeC_8WLl6i_R5XlYXRNeNoG_4MgLi1v9znSJhawIRXyDDSxTr2EP1HJnkAbRKFD7QPTyEvmXiC8Mo0izVNXy1cguVWQymCqcBXDtLDeAhQviLCW-rWV5oBijANi-O2-Yh-OJBaSqE3uBlGybSZ_uiQrQXqIiA4LBT-4bhVLsWoEZ-mkjCbrtygxrbk-gakWXyeBwS-BfEl3G0veYN9UCRKZSjIzOL7fhH6d061TRNV8T_dknEXPKo-BnICBjppptKUubzeeT-q4D6JnqlpzAtE4Q.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/GuYUrUSaYtDlkRmUq28ojXknyDbac3e-hK3KMPj-l41lpo_dHwWAi3ON_jCAk7oPNzya_51npycMDSvTvmywT0_ECZRB27ukmjyWLkTknfuCJAsjO-BV-qzo1pACb6xuXkzGVLcaQA27ReSgPEjY0R2M06de0uL0fAOzhZEPaeBtLRtlik_MtePNNhdmmIu1muxb65Z6LsGfJpmERIc3veIQ8warKR9DPP_3A-aLt0gWzcDjFldDbPxKYqV03icBxE-WNLgZG3TpZO1o6soKUpa1MOKlBWpBPF6-E7x5xFMRAwNo3vXG2u9gS0tI10geNgXWB4SGdjTQMKrCextsHA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/gTc_sgZuucX3TPRjTm_twf9OAe1mKCPbgqvAdfg7dCr8X4BGztYf3INgLi8j3wkEDMlE2wwKMEiwrZhm8bC7-PbkGvOH3OKeDqmi_aaYQscranF3Aw-IOk-jMu3aGDOV3IZ9TmOChj8m4cXjmWjKdbWnGiEu8kSVkXnbaqg-W1ZML-X3XtMDxNfz-ZHvXD7pdgsZ7eKQHKG_FytCebiAXKY4dZfwM3EHvdOtF9GeDLnTietlwsqcDkh8Q9mG04t4BT9Fo-DSwltk6FLLaMe_eDERtbd0XDqbDRz0B0OsYgDDX_QRxunmmevri7tus0GlKfe6ZNnZiMTEPxjNnwA_Wg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/d_bma9Hjj1oea1nTJfuoLQ2nQIRG4OL_xo7lbZPQ0IoEuMHVYdaccbPgF1WSM49Iv7MdCUTGZT1Cf26TXqIH-avDewL8wD_TgGSWs45yrrYt9AlT_Cg_UqlezPsu2ZADsHgfwmUSAB2mFRYxksd28rfHlsgGvjpedz1B57UoS3P_54bH7Yv4ocIkGuNAUFO88FXty00eDJfEWi45raqXxz4D1PkAItekFgLjMItl2GeCfqpUpCbms_nre7WfcbykNgqdOBZ_-0UrADS4Kci30nHrLkVSI6PXe5R7oI3Jyvj_4jOBizD64sTnr9uq_bDWWFh5qukG0HYlxa5e5vy8XQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A1.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9881.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918D.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style